# Desktop pet artwork that is licensed for USE but not for REDISTRIBUTION.
# This repo is public, so the raw sheet must not be committed — it stays on the
# machine that built it. See apps/desktop/ui-next/public/pet/CREDITS.md.
# `shiba.png` and `dino.png` are NOT here: they are generated art we own, cut by
# tools/sprite-cutter.
apps/desktop/ui-next/public/pet/bichon.png

